00:38:11,140 --> 00:38:14,100
And his love secured them where they belonged.

626
00:38:14,100 --> 00:38:15,320
Right?

627
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:18,320
They were lost when they were away from him.

628
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:24,620
I mean, just think about the depth of that language the father's using.

629
00:38:24,620 --> 00:38:25,060
Right?

630
00:38:25,060 --> 00:38:28,560
He's like, I'm giving you belonging.

631
00:38:28,560 --> 00:38:29,840
I'm giving you place.

632
00:38:29,840 --> 00:38:32,840
And again, culturally, again, this is where our culture is different.

633
00:38:32,840 --> 00:38:34,640
For them, culturally, that would have clicked.

634
00:38:34,640 --> 00:38:36,420
They would be like, I'm totally jacking with you.

635
00:38:36,620 --> 00:38:36,880
Right?

636
00:38:37,660 --> 00:38:40,500
Because the father, the family is a large community group.

637
00:38:40,500 --> 00:38:40,720
Right?

638
00:38:40,720 --> 00:38:42,040
It's not just like you and your siblings.

639
00:38:42,040 --> 00:38:42,720
It's like cousins.

640
00:38:42,720 --> 00:38:44,880
Whole community.

641
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:45,360
Whole town.

642
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:46,320
Right?

643
00:38:46,820 --> 00:38:48,640
All anchored in the identity of the father.

644
00:38:48,640 --> 00:38:54,220
And so he's like, I give you a place to belong.

645
00:38:54,220 --> 00:39:04,080
So your identity, your purpose, your place, your community, all from me.

646
00:39:04,080 --> 00:39:07,180
And more specifically, all from my love.

647
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:15,460
So for us, in the same way, the love of God is the most valuable thing that we possess.

648
00:39:15,460 --> 00:39:26,000
And I really want us to think about this, because I don't think that we actually live like that.

649
00:39:28,540 --> 00:39:38,120
And the reason that we don't actually live like that is because, hear me out, because we don't actually believe it.

650
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:51,160
We don't actually believe all the things I just said about what God's love does for us and is for us.

651
00:39:51,160 --> 00:39:52,120
Right?

652
00:39:53,940 --> 00:39:55,040
I mean, think about this.

