00:40:35,440 --> 00:40:39,880
I'm not saying this to convict or to be harsh.

665
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:44,060
I don't even feel like I totally understand God's love, even after everything I've already said.

666
00:40:44,060 --> 00:40:45,020
Right?

667
00:40:45,020 --> 00:40:48,260
But we've just got to be honest.

