00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:57,560
That means we actually believe what he's saying.

687
00:41:57,560 --> 00:42:07,640
And he actually says, you know, these other people, they couldn't enter my rest, not because they weren't worthy, but because they couldn't believe what I was offering.

