00:42:14,180 --> 00:42:17,140
This is Luke chapter 18, verse 16 through 17.

691
00:42:17,140 --> 00:42:17,460
Right?

692
00:42:18,300 --> 00:42:28,420
Yes, I love this story because, again, culturally, the idea that, like, a rabbi like Jesus would have, like, kids messing with him, like, the disciples were like, dude, kids, leave them alone.

