00:42:33,240 --> 00:42:36,200
It was like, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

695
00:42:36,200 --> 00:42:41,600
The way these children are coming to me is the way you have to come to me.

696
00:42:41,600 --> 00:42:42,480
Right?

697
00:42:46,640 --> 00:42:51,840
Because when I tell my little kids I love them, they just believe it.

698
00:42:51,840 --> 00:42:58,900
Like, I have never had to persuade my small children that I love them.

