00:42:58,900 --> 00:43:01,200
Think about that.

700
00:43:01,200 --> 00:43:02,280
You mean?

701
00:43:02,280 --> 00:43:07,480
I've never seen them struggle with that concept.

702
00:43:07,480 --> 00:43:08,580
Right?

703
00:43:09,820 --> 00:43:11,000
Babies don't struggle with it.

704
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:17,320
One of the things I love about having, when we were having little ones, is just how immediately the baby bonds with my wife and their mother.

705
00:43:17,320 --> 00:43:17,600
Right?

706
00:43:17,600 --> 00:43:21,420
And you see, like, her love flowing out, and the baby just soaks it.

707
00:43:21,420 --> 00:43:23,060
Does not struggle.

708
00:43:23,060 --> 00:43:26,020
The baby's like, you know, crying, crying, crying.

709
00:43:26,020 --> 00:43:26,800
No one can make her happy.

710
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:27,780
Touches her.

711
00:43:27,780 --> 00:43:28,380
Immediately the baby.

712
00:43:28,380 --> 00:43:31,120
Right?

713
00:43:31,120 --> 00:43:32,120
You guys know what I'm talking about.

714
00:43:32,120 --> 00:43:33,820
It's like the most beautiful thing in the world.

715
00:43:33,820 --> 00:43:34,460
I love it.

716
00:43:35,200 --> 00:43:37,800
And I look at that, and I go, that's what Jesus is talking about.

717
00:43:37,800 --> 00:43:39,620
You want to come into the kingdom of God?

718
00:43:39,620 --> 00:43:41,120
You got to come in like that.

719
00:43:41,120 --> 00:43:48,940
Stop arguing with me and telling me about your worth, things that I've already made clear it does not matter.

720
00:43:48,940 --> 00:43:50,920
Right?

721
00:43:53,860 --> 00:44:00,900
And as I said at the beginning, we think we have to first understand God's love in order to receive it.

722
00:44:00,900 --> 00:44:02,060
But that's backwards.

723
00:44:02,060 --> 00:44:05,900
Right?

724
00:44:05,900 --> 00:44:09,780
You understand love once you have received it.

725
00:44:09,780 --> 00:44:14,980
That's why, like, when we try and describe love, like, you can't do it.

726
00:44:14,980 --> 00:44:16,820
Right?

727
00:44:16,820 --> 00:44:19,120
But when you have it, you know it.

728
00:44:20,780 --> 00:44:26,360
And so, my encouragement for you guys is also to just, like, stop trying to figure God out.

729
00:44:26,360 --> 00:44:32,020
Stop trying to rationalize and understand it and pull it apart.

730
00:44:32,020 --> 00:44:33,680
Well, I think it's love functions.

731
00:44:33,680 --> 00:44:36,440
I said, just, why don't you just shut up and receive it?

732
00:44:36,440 --> 00:44:40,020
You know what I'm saying?

733
00:44:40,020 --> 00:44:44,000
Again, I've never had an intellectual conversation with my children about love.

734
00:44:44,000 --> 00:44:44,460
Ever.

735
00:44:44,460 --> 00:44:44,520
Ever.

736
00:44:50,780 --> 00:44:56,400
Do we have to be constantly reminded and convinced or are we still trying to understand and rationalize it?

737
00:44:56,400 --> 00:44:56,600
Right?

738
00:44:56,600 --> 00:44:57,900
That's what we have to ask ourselves.

739
00:44:57,900 --> 00:45:02,340
And then secondly, so first we got to receive it.

740
00:45:02,340 --> 00:45:03,240
We got to meditate on it.

741
00:45:03,240 --> 00:45:04,060
We got to sit in it.

742
00:45:04,060 --> 00:45:07,280
That's a pretty funny story.

743
00:45:07,280 --> 00:45:08,080
I know she won't mind.

744
00:45:08,080 --> 00:45:14,500
Like, I had, through a series of events in my life in the last seven years,

745
00:45:14,500 --> 00:45:23,360
I'd really gone through a lot of things relationally with my parents and I was finding a level of love in God that I hadn't known before.

746
00:45:23,360 --> 00:45:27,720
And, you know, like, especially if you're married, like, God's doing something in you.

747
00:45:27,720 --> 00:45:29,100
And, you know, just not you and your spouse.

748
00:45:29,100 --> 00:45:30,080
You're just at the same time.

749
00:45:30,080 --> 00:45:32,600
And, you know, so there's that little bit.

750
00:45:32,600 --> 00:45:34,860
You know, God's working with things in my wife and things in me.

751
00:45:34,860 --> 00:45:36,900
And the things in me were really about this love.

752
00:45:36,900 --> 00:45:39,620
And I remember, like, just one day my wife was just, you know, just really stressed.

753
00:45:39,620 --> 00:45:40,500
We have five kids, right?

754
00:45:40,500 --> 00:45:41,980
So, I mean, obviously she's stressed.

755
00:45:41,980 --> 00:45:44,880
And, you know, so she was like, I'm just going to go.

756
00:45:44,880 --> 00:45:45,740
I'm going to read my Bible.

757
00:45:45,740 --> 00:45:46,420
I'm going to make coffee.

758
00:45:46,420 --> 00:45:47,700
Like, what should I do?

759
00:45:47,700 --> 00:45:52,380
Like, she asked me for advice, which, you know, a not super common occurrence.

760
00:45:52,380 --> 00:45:54,860
And I was like, oh, yeah, this is great.

761
00:45:54,860 --> 00:45:58,340
Like, okay, she actually wants me to solve a problem for once.

762
00:45:58,340 --> 00:45:59,440
This is amazing.

763
00:45:59,440 --> 00:46:00,320
It's my dream.

764
00:46:00,320 --> 00:46:01,580
I'm going to write this down in my diary.

765
00:46:01,580 --> 00:46:06,620
And like today she had a problem and actually wanted a solution.

766
00:46:06,900 --> 00:46:07,760
Like, that was a new thing.

767
00:46:07,760 --> 00:46:08,840
And it was great.

768
00:46:08,840 --> 00:46:12,500
She's not here to defend herself.

769
00:46:12,500 --> 00:46:13,000
That's not fair.

770
00:46:13,000 --> 00:46:17,620
Anyway, and I just knew what was going on.

771
00:46:17,620 --> 00:46:19,340
And I knew what she was stressed about.

772
00:46:19,340 --> 00:46:21,040
And I said to her, I go, hear me out.

773
00:46:21,040 --> 00:46:30,840
When you go out for coffee, just meditate on the love of God for you.

774
00:46:30,840 --> 00:46:34,200
And she immediately was like, what is that going to do?

775
00:46:34,200 --> 00:46:36,140
And then grabs her bottle.

776
00:46:36,760 --> 00:46:38,300
I was like, just try it.

777
00:46:38,300 --> 00:46:39,060
She's like, okay.

778
00:46:39,060 --> 00:46:40,340
And she leaves.

779
00:46:40,340 --> 00:46:41,920
And she came back like two hours later.

780
00:46:41,920 --> 00:46:43,180
She was like, oh, my gosh.

781
00:46:43,180 --> 00:46:47,260
Like, anxiety melted away.

782
00:46:47,260 --> 00:46:50,020
Anger melted away.

783
00:46:50,020 --> 00:46:51,420
Right?

784
00:46:51,420 --> 00:46:53,620
And I was like, look, I'm not that smart.

785
00:46:53,620 --> 00:46:55,320
I'm just telling you what I've been recently doing.

786
00:46:55,320 --> 00:46:56,700
And it's been transforming my life.

787
00:46:56,700 --> 00:46:57,740
Right?

788
00:46:59,320 --> 00:47:01,900
So, we've got to learn to value it above all things.

789
00:47:01,900 --> 00:47:04,300
Financial security.

790
00:47:04,300 --> 00:47:07,880
I'm going to say that one again.

791
00:47:07,880 --> 00:47:13,240
Financial security, which is an oxymoron, by the way.

792
00:47:14,200 --> 00:47:15,360
Like, it's a contradiction of terms.

793
00:47:15,360 --> 00:47:18,880
If you don't get that, just wait.

794
00:47:18,880 --> 00:47:22,420
We'll check back.

795
00:47:22,420 --> 00:47:23,500
We'll check back in a year.

796
00:47:23,500 --> 00:47:24,040
Okay?

797
00:47:24,040 --> 00:47:26,820
Financial security is an oxymoron, right?

798
00:47:26,820 --> 00:47:27,580
Financial security.

799
00:47:28,120 --> 00:47:29,080
Situational peace.

800
00:47:29,080 --> 00:47:31,340
Okay?

801
00:47:31,340 --> 00:47:36,700
Like, I'll have peace here when all of you guys get your act together.

802
00:47:36,700 --> 00:47:38,880
Right?

803
00:47:38,880 --> 00:47:42,500
When everyone can just stop burning, setting things on fire, I'll have peace.

804
00:47:42,500 --> 00:47:42,820
Right?

805
00:47:42,820 --> 00:47:43,720
Situational peace.

806
00:47:43,720 --> 00:47:46,160
The love and the acceptance of others.

807
00:47:46,160 --> 00:47:49,320
Achievement.

808
00:47:49,320 --> 00:47:50,880
Performance.

809
00:47:50,880 --> 00:47:53,020
Power.

810
00:47:53,020 --> 00:47:53,860
Influence.

811
00:47:53,860 --> 00:47:54,800
Nothing.

812
00:47:57,580 --> 00:47:59,000
Please hear this this morning.

813
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:01,840
Everything I just listed is nothing.

814
00:48:01,840 --> 00:48:05,220
In comparison.

815
00:48:05,220 --> 00:48:07,640
To the love of God.

816
00:48:07,640 --> 00:48:12,620
There's nothing in comparison.

817
00:48:12,620 --> 00:48:14,020
So, I'm going to close with this.

818
00:48:14,020 --> 00:48:17,520
Because you can kind of hear Paul's heart.

819
00:48:17,520 --> 00:48:21,980
And wanting the church in Ephesus to understand this.

820
00:48:21,980 --> 00:48:23,720
So, I'm just going to close with this passage.

821
00:48:23,720 --> 00:48:25,240
This is Ephesians chapter 3.

822
00:48:25,240 --> 00:48:27,440
Verse 14.

823
00:48:28,400 --> 00:48:29,280
It says,

824
00:48:29,280 --> 00:48:38,160
For this reason, I kneel before the Father, from whom every family in heaven and on earth is named.

825
00:48:38,160 --> 00:48:40,740
Hear that language of identity?

826
00:48:40,740 --> 00:48:42,200
Right?

827
00:48:42,200 --> 00:48:44,180
Verse 16.

828
00:48:44,420 --> 00:48:59,580
I pray that he may grant you, according to the riches of his glory, to be strengthened with power in your inner being through his spirit.

829
00:48:59,580 --> 00:49:19,560
I pray that you, being rooted and firmly established in love, may be able to comprehend with all the saints what is the length and the width and the height and the depth of God's love.

830
00:49:19,560 --> 00:49:20,060
And to know Christ's love.

831
00:49:20,060 --> 00:49:30,020
And to know Christ's love that surpasses knowledge so that you may be filled with all the fullness of God.

832
00:49:31,480 --> 00:49:32,580
So, let's pray.

833
00:49:32,580 --> 00:49:35,780
Lord, that is our prayer today.

834
00:49:35,780 --> 00:49:43,200
We cannot discover your love.

835
00:49:44,000 --> 00:49:45,860
We can't figure it out.

836
00:49:45,860 --> 00:49:49,480
We can't rationalize our way to it.

837
00:49:49,480 --> 00:49:53,440
It has to be received.

838
00:49:53,440 --> 00:50:01,800
Only through the presence of your spirit can we know your love.

839
00:50:02,960 --> 00:50:04,720
Reveal your love to us this morning.

840
00:50:04,720 --> 00:50:12,420
As we open our hearts, Lord God, let us have a fresh taste of your love.

841
00:50:12,420 --> 00:50:20,720
To begin to understand its value and its place in our lives.

842
00:50:20,720 --> 00:50:27,000
Let us be firmly rooted and established in your love this morning.

843
00:50:29,120 --> 00:50:34,300
Let us be people who are like beacons of your love.

844
00:50:34,300 --> 00:50:41,440
Shining to the people around us who have not yet experienced it.

845
00:50:41,440 --> 00:50:52,340
Father, we want to know your love this morning.

846
00:50:52,340 --> 00:50:54,420
Reveal it to us.

847
00:50:54,420 --> 00:50:56,400
You're your son.

848
00:50:56,400 --> 00:50:58,680
In Jesus' name.

849
00:50:59,120 --> 00:50:59,480
Amen.
